WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.087
It's hugely rewarding when 
you have a small idea

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:07.799
and it's embraced by the 
community and brought to life.

00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:11.761
Philanthropy is about giving,
but what about giving up?

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:16.182
Is there a course or a 
committee or a board

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:19.269
that you could step aside 
from for somebody else?

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:24.024
Is there a story you can listen 
to from a former refugee

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:28.204
or stick up for somebody 
at the dinner table?

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:32.532
Small acts multiplied 
by thousands

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:35.778
can transform the world.

00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:40.457
Do you believe in the 
power of community?

